  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3008.03 Monitoring",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3008.03 Monitoring. In order to demonstrate that the amount and rate of ERCs are quantifiable, by definition, Generator sources and any person to whom ERCs are transferred to shall comply with the testing and monitoring requirements specified in Env-A 800, applicable control technology guidance documents issued by EPA, or any other method approved by the department and EPA.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
